WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,590 --> 00:00:02,990
Kaya natuwa si Grandma

2
00:00:02,990 --> 00:00:05,390
Ah, si Grandma Oreo pala

3
00:00:05,390 --> 00:00:11,700
Teka — lobo ba yan?

4
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:12,900
Maging mabait, Huihui

5
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:14,700
Nandito na tayo sa bahay!

6
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:18,560
Itong aso nga

7
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:21,400
Snob na ang mga aso ngayon ah

8
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:22,600
Manahimik kayo!

9
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:23,800
Hello po, Uncle

10
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:24,800
Hello po, Ate

11
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:26,000
Ako si Yoyo

12
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,980
Miss Yoyo

13
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:30,220
Dating-dating niyo lang po

14
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:31,820
Ako na po ang magbuhat ng bag

15
00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:32,820
Hindi na po

16
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:34,620
Pasalubong po ito ni Yoyo

17
00:00:34,620 --> 00:00:36,580
para sa lolo, Lola at mga kuya

18
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:37,980
Pasalubong?

19
00:00:37,980 --> 00:00:39,700
Isang pulubing galing sa probinsya

20
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:42,620
papapasukin pa sa bahay ng mga Pei

21
00:00:42,620 --> 00:00:44,940
Si Miss Yoyo ang tunay na anak ng mga Pei

22
00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:46,540
Tunay na anak?

23
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:48,020
Si Miss Jiaojiao na aming inalaga

24
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:49,340
ang tunay na kanak-kanak

25
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:50,420
Galing pa siya sa probinsya

26
00:00:50,420 --> 00:00:57,490
Baka may mikrobyo pa yan

27
00:00:57,490 --> 00:00:59,330
Ituloy mo pa at gawin kitang aso-hotpot

28
00:00:59,330 --> 00:01:01,520
Hindi ko maintindihan

29
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:03,620
pero ang sama ng mga sinasabi

30
00:01:03,620 --> 00:01:05,140
Matandang bruha ka

31
00:01:05,140 --> 00:01:06,620
Kamukha mo ang hotpot

32
00:01:06,620 --> 00:01:08,140
Hotpot din ang pamilya mo

33
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:09,780
Kapal ng mukha niyong buully si Yoyo

34
00:01:09,780 --> 00:01:11,900
Bibitin ko ang paa mo!

35
00:01:11,900 --> 00:01:18,030
Kumakagat ka pala?!

36
00:01:18,030 --> 00:01:18,950
Kung ako sa iyo

37
00:01:18,950 --> 00:01:20,710
Buhatin mo na yang mga kalat at umalis

38
00:01:20,750 --> 00:01:23,010
Maligayang pagdating, Yoyo

39
00:01:23,010 --> 00:01:24,650
Ikaw ang muling pagkatawo ng Matanda ng Yushou Sect

40
00:01:24,650 --> 00:01:25,810
may proteksyon ng langit

41
00:01:25,810 --> 00:01:27,690
Kailangan nila ng aral

42
00:01:27,690 --> 00:01:28,890
Eh di magpanggap akong may rabies

43
00:01:28,890 --> 00:01:29,850
Magpapanggap kang may rabies?

44
00:01:29,850 --> 00:01:34,460
Takutin sila

45
00:01:34,460 --> 00:01:35,500
Kailan pa

46
00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:38,750
nang napatalsik ng kasambahay ang tunay na anak ng mga Pei

47
00:01:38,750 --> 00:01:40,670
Naawa lang ako kay Miss Jiaojiao

48
00:01:40,670 --> 00:01:42,390
Umiyak siya buong gabi kagabi

49
00:01:42,390 --> 00:01:44,380
at nagkasakit hanggang ma-ospital

50
00:01:44,380 --> 00:01:45,780
Pei Yoyo ang pangalan niya

51
00:01:45,780 --> 00:01:47,100
Tunay kong kapatid

52
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:50,380
Naintindihan ba ninyo? Tapos na.

53
00:01:50,380 --> 00:01:51,420
Isang batang maliit

54
00:01:51,420 --> 00:01:57,240
bumubuhat ng malaking bag — eto, mga kuya

55
00:01:57,240 --> 00:01:58,640
Mabigat po ito

56
00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:00,240
Gaano kabigat ang gamit ng isang bata?

57
00:02:00,240 --> 00:02:03,380
Hindi ko nga maangat ang isa

58
00:02:03,380 --> 00:02:05,300
maliit na bag ng isang bata
